[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706687672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103768#issuecomment-2706687672","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103768","id":2706687672,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hVMa4","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T15:08:27Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T15:08:27Z","body":"I do really like this warning, but I wouldn't use it unless I could suppress the warning for a single line. Is that possible with the current code analysis system?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706687672/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706690539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103768#issuecomment-2706690539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103768","id":2706690539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hVNHr","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T15:09:19Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T15:09:19Z","body":"As for the bug, \"no warning when the current class has the same private member as the accessed class that is not the super class of the current class\", this is because the method `check_access_private_member()` only deals with the identifier passed in and a flag about if the pattern to be reduced or having been reduced is a call or not, in which there is a line:\r\n```Cpp\r\nif (parser->current_class->has_member(p_identifier->name)) {\r\n    return;\r\n}\r\n```\r\nFor example, if A and B has the same signatured function, while they are not derived from the other one:\r\n```GDScript\r\nclass A:\r\n    var _t := 1\r\n\r\nclass B:\r\n    var a := A.new()\r\n    var _t := 2\r\n\r\n    func _init() -> void:\r\n        a._t = 3 # No warning as B has a member with the same name `_t`\r\n```\r\nDunno how to deal with this as during reduction you cannot infer the details of the subscript base, except its type and name.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706690539/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706699279","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103768#issuecomment-2706699279","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103768","id":2706699279,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hVPQP","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T15:12:05Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T15:12:53Z","body":"> I do really like this warning, but I wouldn't use it unless I could suppress the warning for a single line. Is that possible with the current code analysis system?\r\n\r\nYou can ignore the warning with `@warning_ignore(\"access_private_member\")`, or use `@warning_ignore_start(\"access_private_member\")` (and ends with `@warning_ignore_restore(\"access_private_member\")`) for access to multiple private members","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706699279/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708702499","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103768#issuecomment-2708702499","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103768","id":2708702499,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hc4Uj","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T06:52:51Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T06:52:51Z","body":"Everything is now ready for review :D","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"ur